WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:05,520
Boss, didn't you see it?

2
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:07,520
You actually know so many companions who can enter the secret realm

3
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:08,920
Stop talking nonsense and tell the truth

4
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:10,120
Calling everyone today

5
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:11,920
The first thing to do is to finalize the reasonable rewards for the secret realm.

6
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:12,920
The ugly words come first

7
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:14,520
So as not to hurt everyone’s friendship later

8
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:17,700
Regular team healers get 5%

9
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:19,700
The remaining supplies are divided according to the amount of output

10
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:22,300
But it was Li Mo who won the qualification to enter the secret realm this time.

11
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:24,100
Without him, we wouldn't be able to enter the secret realm

12
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:27,180
I propose that Li Mo can get 20% of the supplies.

13
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:28,980
Five percent of the basic share of the camp guarantee

14
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:31,780
The remaining 75% of the supplies will be divided according to the amount paid.

15
00:00:32,410 --> 00:00:33,610
I agree with both hands

16
00:00:34,210 --> 00:00:37,810
Did I take too much of this?

17
00:00:37,810 --> 00:00:39,870
This is what healers deserve

18
00:00:39,870 --> 00:00:41,270
I'll add one more

19
00:00:41,270 --> 00:00:43,470
If you get a treasure that suits a certain team member

20
00:00:43,470 --> 00:00:50,990
This team member can be exchanged for priority at 20% off the market price.

21
00:00:50,990 --> 00:00:52,190
The division plan has been decided

22
00:00:52,190 --> 00:00:53,790
Then let me tell you the second thing

23
00:00:53,790 --> 00:00:56,020
The probability of survival in the secret realm is only 50%

24
00:00:56,020 --> 00:00:58,420
Are you really ready to face a life or death crisis?
